Stake_Lido_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when wethAmount zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when wethAmount non zero
   ├── given vault has not approved adapter on WETH
   │  └── it should revert on transferFrom
   └── given vault approved adapter on WETH
      ├── it should pull WETH from vault
      ├── it should unwrap WETH to ETH
      ├── it should submit ETH to Lido
      ├── it should forward stETH to vault using transferShares
      ├── it should leave zero ETH WETH and stETH-shares in adapter
      └── it should return non zero stETHReceived
